ional partnerships. As part of our commitment to global engagement, we are proud to announce that we have already signed Memorandums of Understanding (MoUs) with two internationally renowned institutions:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Fraunhofer-Gesellschaft<\/strong>, Germany \u2013 Europe\u2019s leading applied research organization, known for its innovation-driven collaborations with academia and industry. <strong><span style=\"color: #b72928;\"><a style=\"color: #b72928;\" href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Fraunhofer-Gesellschaft.pdf\">Click Here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Kansas State University<\/strong>, USA \u2013 A top-tier research university recognized for its contributions to science, technology, and global education. <span style=\"color: #b72928;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #b72928;\" href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Kansas-State-University.pdf\">Click Here.<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5bbbad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e5bbbad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These partnerships will open new avenues for collaborative research, faculty and student exchange programs, and joint academic initiatives that benefit our university community and contribute to the global knowledge economy.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Indian Institute of Rice Research (IIRR), India<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Western Sydney University, Australia<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>University of Florida, USA<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>are currently in the final stages of approval<\/strong> and are expected to be completed by the end of this month. These upcoming collaborations will further expand Kaveri University\u2019s global network and enrich our academic and research environment.<\/p><p>Stay tuned as we continue<strong> to build bridges across borders and bring the world closer to Kaveri.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Global Collaborations At Kaveri University, we believe that academic excellence is strengthened through meaningful international partnerships. As part&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-844","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kaveri University | Courses in Agricultural Studies | Telangana<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kaveri University offers UG, PG, and Doctoral Programs in Agricultural Sciences, Technology, Food and Nutrition, Agribusiness Management, Forestry etc.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/academic-collaborations\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kaveri University | Courses in Agricultural Studies | Telangana\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kaveri University offers UG, PG, and Doctoral Programs in Agricultural Sciences, Technology, Food and Nutrition, Agribusiness Management, Forestry etc.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/academic-collaborations\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kaveri University\" \/>\n<meta property